__pycache__/
.venv/
.venv*
.idea/
.vscode
!.gitignore
.storage
.test_files
.storage*
.test_files*
# The old runtime dirs, ignored whole: since DGO-2019 the store is the DGO folder's data/apitools/{storage,logs},
# which the data move filled from these once (moved_from `path:`) and leaves as they were. Nothing binds them any
# more, so nothing ships in them (they were bind sources, kept by a .gitkeep, before) — and an office's copy of its
# state left here never rides the tree (G118 H4: an old folder holds no tracked file and is ignored from outside it).
logs/
storage/

.scraps*/
.coverage
